    14	     non-bg color. The palette direction is reversed: outer line = interior-key color,
    15	     inner line = border color. The solver uses the existing interior color as the lookup key,
    16	     checks which border color it maps to, and recolors the entire enclosed interior region to
    17	     that border color.
    18	   - Small trace:
